      "license_url": "http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/",
      "license": "CC0-1.0",
      "description": "A heavily time-stretched transformation of the original sound source, slowed down to approximately 20% of its original speed. The processing included subtle frequency filtering and adjustments to make the texture suitable for seamless looping.\n\nThe result resembles a slow-moving machine, industrial mechanism, or abstract mechanical drone with a dark and atmospheric quality.\n\nProcessing:\n\nExtreme time stretching (20% speed)\nFrequency range adjustment\nLoop preparation\nOriginal source:\n<a href=\"https://freesound.org/people/JonCon_Library/sounds/483122/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/JonCon_Library/sounds/483122/</a>",
